---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="[Alumni Service] ViVouch Alumni Referral & Vouching Platform Closed Beta Launched | NACUAA NorCal" description="Say no to resume black holes and paid referral brokers. NACUAA NorCal, NACUAA AI Venture and Impact Club, ZJUAA NC, and VI AI Foundation officially launch the closed beta test for ViVouch." path="/en/posts/2026-09-17-vivouch-alumni-referral-system-closed-beta/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/posts/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to News & Events</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2 flex-wrap gap-y-1">
          <time datetime="2026-09-17">Thursday, September 17, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">Alumni Service</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 font-semibold">Closed Beta</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          ViVouch Alumni Referral & Vouching Platform Closed Beta Launched
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base text-blue-400 font-medium">
          Vouched by alumni. Submitted by them. · Direct 1-on-1 Referrals · Career connections through alumni
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-x-2 flex-wrap">
          <span>Jointly Initiated: VI AI Foundation × NACUAA NorCal × NACUAA AI Venture and Impact Club × ZJUAA NC</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Event Hero Poster Banner -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl">
        <img src="/images/vivouch_career_banner.jpg" alt="ViVouch Alumni Referral & Vouching Platform" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
      </div>

      <!-- Action / Highlight Card -->
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-950/40 via-slate-900 to-purple-950/40 border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-3xl space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600/20 border border-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 text-lg shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake-angle"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white">Closed Beta Intake Now Open (Cohort #1)</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Strictly limited to 30 verified tech mentors / referrers and matching seeker waitlist</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i>
              <span>Alumni Mentor / Referrer Intake</span>
            </span>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Connecting alumni at Google, Meta, OpenAI, Microsoft, Apple, and top quant firms. AI generates 150-word Workday blurbs. 15-second bounded vouching with zero liability.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-2">
              <a href="https://v.vi.fyi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300">
                <span>Register as Referrer (v.vi.fyi)</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
              <span>Job Seeker Fast-Track Queue</span>
            </span>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Open to all alumni upon verification. No existing senior connections required. 15-minute ephemeral pre-signed URLs, zero model pre-training on resumes.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-2">
              <a href="https://c.vi.fyi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300">
                <span>Join Seeker Waitlist (c.vi.fyi)</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye text-blue-400"></i>
          <span>Why Did We Launch ViVouch?</span>
        </h3>

        <p>
          In today's challenging tech hiring landscape, job seekers face cold outreach portals where resumes disappear into black holes, while commercial referral brokers commodify internal referrals, triggering corporate compliance crackdowns.
        </p>

        <p>
          To solve this with integrity, <strong>NACUAA NorCal</strong>, <strong>NACUAA AI Venture and Impact Club</strong>, <strong>ZJUAA NC</strong>, and <strong>VI AI Foundation</strong> have teamed up to build a 100% free, non-profit alumni career infrastructure: <strong>ViVouch</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-emerald-400"></i>
            <span>Core Principles & Mechanism Guarantees</span>
          </h4>
          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-300 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
            <li><strong>Vouched by alumni. Submitted by them.</strong>: No automated bot submissions. Real alumni put their name next to yours and submit directly via internal company portals.</li>
            <li><strong>Full Supply-Side Protection</strong>: AI synthesizes 150-word internal blurbs. <strong>3-tier bounded vouching</strong> (Confirming shared project / Validating technical depth / Direct team referral) completed in 15 seconds with <strong>zero joint liability</strong>; capped at 2–3 candidates/week.</li>
            <li><strong>Inclusive for All Alumni</strong>: All verified alumni can join the queue. Even if you just arrived in North America without an existing alumni network, our joint council dispatch grants equitable access.</li>
            <li><strong>Zero-Data-Retention & Privacy</strong>: 15-minute ephemeral pre-signed URLs, strict CCPA/EEOC compliance, and absolute zero data retention for LLM pre-training.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 pt-4">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired text-purple-400"></i>
          <span>Official Domain & Routing Matrix</span>
        </h3>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
            <thead class="bg-slate-900/80 text-slate-200">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3">Portal / Gateway</th>
                <th class="p-3">URL</th>
                <th class="p-3">Purpose</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800 text-slate-400 font-mono">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans text-white font-medium">NACUAA Official Gateway</td>
                <td class="p-3"><a href="https://career.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 underline">career.nacuaa.ai</a></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans">Alliance direct alumni certification gateway</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans text-white font-medium">Primary Global System Authority</td>
                <td class="p-3"><a href="https://career.weiai.ai" target="_blank" class="text-indigo-400 underline">career.weiai.ai</a></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans">ViVouch primary portal and collaboration desk</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans text-white font-medium">Job Seeker Shortlink</td>
                <td class="p-3"><a href="https://c.vi.fyi" target="_blank" class="text-cyan-400 underline">c.vi.fyi</a></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans">Direct access to seeker registration form</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans text-white font-medium">Mentor / Referrer Shortlink</td>
                <td class="p-3"><a href="https://v.vi.fyi" target="_blank" class="text-purple-400 underline">v.vi.fyi</a> / <a href="https://r.vi.fyi" target="_blank" class="text-purple-400 underline">r.vi.fyi</a></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans">Direct access to referrer intake desk</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans text-white font-medium">ZJUAA NC Dedicated Gateway</td>
                <td class="p-3"><a href="https://career.zjuaanc.org" target="_blank" class="text-emerald-400 underline">career.zjuaanc.org</a></td>
                <td class="p-3 font-sans">ZJUAA NC chapter alumni gateway</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 pt-2 italic">
          Note: Beta capacity is strictly capped for Cohort #1. Alumni leaders, in-service tech mentors, and candidates are warmly invited to test the platform and provide early feedback.
        </p>
      </div>

      <footer class="border-t border-slate-900 pt-8 mt-12 flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <a href="/en/posts/" class="hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left mr-1"></i> Back to all News & Events
        </a>
        <span>Published: September 17, 2026</span>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
